    "misfits": [
      {
        "what": "The page is one class of an 18-class national (the class menu lists PRO ... EXHIBITION); each class is a separate URL and a separate document. The protocol cannot say that a document covers only part of the event's results, so merging the class pages into one event depends on the event id in the URL.",
